<section id="finance">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="head reveal">
      <span class="section-label">The parts nobody asks about, until they need them</span>
      <h2>Fees, certificates, AI and the details that matter.</h2>
      <p>Money in and out on one ledger, certificates issued the moment a student finishes, a built-in assistant, and the quiet details that save the most time.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stack">

      <div class="stack-card reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="stack-idx"><span class="n">01</span>Fees</div>
          <h3 class="stack-title">Money in, on the same ledger.</h3>
          <p class="stack-desc">Record a payment against a student's fee agreement and a challan is raised automatically — downloadable as PDF and emailed the moment SMTP is configured.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-visual">
          <div class="doc">
            <div class="doc-head">
              <div><div class="t">Fee Challan</div><div class="s">CH-2026-01847 · Ahsan Khalid · STU-0412</div></div>
              <span class="pill">Due 20 Sep</span>
            </div>
            <div class="doc-rows">
              <div class="doc-row"><span>Total fee — Web Development</span><span>36,000</span></div>
              <div class="doc-row"><span>Discount</span><span>−2,000</span></div>
              <div class="doc-row"><span>Paid 2 Sep — cash</span><span>−18,000</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="doc-total"><span class="l">Balance due</span><span class="v">Rs 16,000</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stack-card reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="stack-idx"><span class="n">02</span>Payroll</div>
          <h3 class="stack-title">Money out, off the same chart of accounts.</h3>
          <p class="stack-desc">Fixed or percentage-based salary, commission spread across the months fees are actually collected, and one-click processing with a full run history.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-visual">
          <div class="doc">
            <div class="doc-head">
              <div><div class="t">Payslip</div><div class="s">September 2026 · Sana Iftikhar · Instructor</div></div>
              <span class="pill ok">Released</span>
            </div>
            <div class="doc-rows">
              <div class="doc-row"><span>Base salary — fixed</span><span>85,000</span></div>
              <div class="doc-row"><span>Commission — spread from Aug &amp; Sep fee collections</span><span>12,000</span></div>
              <div class="doc-row"><span>Allowance — transport</span><span>3,000</span></div>
              <div class="doc-row"><span>Deduction — advance recovery</span><span>−1,850</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="doc-total"><span class="l">Total payable</span><span class="v">Rs 98,150</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stack-card reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="stack-idx"><span class="n">03</span>Certificates</div>
          <h3 class="stack-title">The last mile, handled by the system.</h3>
          <p class="stack-desc">When a student finishes, the certificate is already waiting in their portal — issued under the institute's own name, with the course, grade and marks pulled straight from the gradebook.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-visual">
          <div class="doc">
            <div class="doc-head">
              <div><div class="t">Certificate of Completion</div><div class="s">Mahnoor Zubair · Web Development</div></div>
              <span class="pill ok">Issued</span>
            </div>
            <div class="doc-rows">
              <div class="doc-row"><span>Duration</span><span>3 Months</span></div>
              <div class="doc-row"><span>Grade</span><span>A</span></div>
              <div class="doc-row"><span>Marks</span><span>92 / 100</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="doc-total"><span class="l">Issue date</span><span class="v sm">16 Sep 2026</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stack-card reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="stack-idx"><span class="n">04</span>Built-in assistant</div>
          <h3 class="stack-title">Ask a question in plain language, get an answer from live data.</h3>
          <p class="stack-desc">The AI assistant answers plain-language questions from your institute's own live data, scoped to exactly what the logged-in role is allowed to see.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-visual">
          <div class="ai">
            <div class="ai-head">
              <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 8V4H8"/><rect x="4" y="8" width="16" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M2 14h2M20 14h2M9 13v2M15 13v2"/></svg></div>
              <div class="tt"><b>XF AI (Alpha) — Unstable</b><span>Super Admin live data assistant</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-body">
              <div class="bubble me">How much is still outstanding in Gulberg this month?</div>
              <div class="bubble it"><b>Rs 612,400</b> outstanding across 47 students in Gulberg for September. The largest single balance is Rs 28,000. Nine of these are more than 14 days overdue.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stack-card reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="stack-idx"><span class="n">05</span>Students</div>
          <h3 class="stack-title">Bulk import, with a receipt.</h3>
          <p class="stack-desc">Upload the template and every row is validated before anything touches your database — you see exactly what came in.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-visual">
          <div class="glance-mini">
            <div class="drop">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3v12"/><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5"/><path d="M4 21h16"/></svg>
              <span>Students Import.xlsx</span>
            </div>
            <div class="import-chips">
              <span class="c ok">Imported 42</span>
              <span class="c">Skipped 3</span>
              <span class="c warn">2 errors</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stack-card reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="stack-idx"><span class="n">06</span>Academics</div>
          <h3 class="stack-title">One click, and it's live.</h3>
          <p class="stack-desc">Schedule a session against a batch and a meeting link generates itself — nothing to copy from another tab.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-visual">
          <div class="glance-mini">
            <div class="vclass-card">
              <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m22 8-6 4 6 4V8Z"/><rect x="2" y="6" width="14" height="12" rx="2"/></svg></div>
              <div class="body">
                <div class="t">Week 3 Lecture</div>
                <div class="m">18 Sep, 6:00 PM</div>
              </div>
              <span class="vclass-join">Join</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stack-card reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="stack-idx"><span class="n">07</span>Main</div>
          <h3 class="stack-title">The system tells you first.</h3>
          <p class="stack-desc">SMTP status, delivery logs and alert rules, so a bounced fee reminder never goes unnoticed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-visual">
          <div class="glance-mini">
            <div class="smtp-row"><span>Host</span><span>set</span></div>
            <div class="smtp-row"><span>Alerts enabled</span><span>yes</span></div>
            <div class="smtp-log"><span class="dot"></span>Fee reminder → sent → 47 recipients</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
